            "propertiesJson": "{\"inputPorts\":\"{\\\"formData\\\":\\\"object\\\"}\",\"outputPorts\":\"{\\\"row\\\":\\\"object\\\"}\",\"script\":\"const row={...(inputs.formData||{})}; const required=[\\\"applicant\\\",\\\"department\\\",\\\"expense_type\\\",\\\"expense_date\\\",\\\"amount\\\",\\\"description\\\"]; const missing=required.filter(k=>row[k]===undefined||row[k]===null||String(row[k]).trim()===\\\"\\\"); if(missing.length) throw new Error(\\\"缺少必填字段：\\\"+missing.join(\\\"、\\\")); if(Number(row.amount)<=0) throw new Error(\\\"报销金额必须大于0\\\"); if(row.expense_type===\\\"其他\\\"&&String(row.description).trim().length<10) throw new Error(\\\"费用类型为其他时，费用说明不得少于10个字\\\"); if(Number(row.amount)>500&&row.has_invoice!==true) throw new Error(\\\"报销金额超过500元时必须有发票\\\"); if(row.approval_status&&row.approval_status!==\\\"草稿\\\") throw new Error(\\\"只有草稿可以提交或修改\\\"); const now=new Date(); const p=n=>String(n).padStart(2,\\\"0\\\"); row.reimbursement_no=row.reimbursement_no||(\\\"BX\\\"+now.getFullYear()+p(now.getMonth()+1)+p(now.getDate())+p(now.getHours())+p(now.getMinutes())+p(now.getSeconds())); row.application_time=now.toISOString(); row.approval_status=\\\"待审批\\\"; row.approver=\\\"\\\"; row.approval_comment=\\\"\\\"; row.approval_time=\\\"\\\"; return {row};\"}",
            "connectedPortsJson": "[]"
          }
